    obo:IAO_0000115 "A texture quality inhering in bark, another surface, or a plant axis bearing that surface by virtue of its being marked by deep cracks or clefts."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000116 "FLOPO-local value class beneath PATO PATO:0000150 (texture), added 2026-10-06 for quality words of the parsed flora corpora (evidence: fissured (6)). Candidate for submission to PATO."@en ;
