    obo:IAO_0000116 "FLOPO-local value class beneath PATO PATO:0000052 (shape), added 2026-10-15 for quality words of the parsed flora corpora (evidence: horned (NCVC 2, Collenette 6)). Candidate for submission to PATO. Review: 2026-11-08: accepted as a reviewed FLOPO flora value; definition and PATO parent checked"@en ;
